REGENT OF BUNGO
JAMBI PROVINCE
REGIONAL REGULATION OF BUNGO REGENCY
NUMBER 7 YEAR 2022
CONCERNING
PROTECTION OF WOMEN
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
REGENT OF BUNGO,

Considering:
a. that every citizen including women has equal rights to obtain a sense of security and freedom from the state to conduct activities in various aspects of life as guaranteed in Pancasila and the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
b. that there are still many occurrences of gender-based violence against women and violence that treats women disproportionately in various aspects of life so that there is a need for concrete guarantees of women's rights from the government as state administrator through regional government supported by various parties;
c. that.....2 In View of: 2-
c. that the Bungo Regency Government as regional government administrator does not yet have regional legal products to guarantee women's rights in various aspects of life in Bungo Regency so that there is a need for regulations regarding the protection of women as a legal basis;
d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation on the Protection of Women;

In View of:
1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 12 Year 1956 concerning the Establishment of Autonomous Regency Regions Within the Central Sumatra Provincial Region (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1956 Number 25) as amended by Law Number 7 Year 1965 concerning the Establishment of Level II Region of Sarolangun Bangko and Level II Region of Tanjung Jabung (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1965 Number 50, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 2755);
3. Law Number 7 Year 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (Convention On The Elimination Of All Forms Of Discrimination Against Women) (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1984 Number 29, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia 3277);
4.Law.....3 -3-
4. Law Number 39 Year 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);
5. Law Number 23 Year 2004 concerning the Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);
6. Law Number 13 Year 2006 concerning Protection of Witnesses and Victims (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2006 Number 64, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4635) as amended by Law Number 31 Year 2014 concerning Amendment to Law Number 13 Year 2006 concerning Protection of Witnesses and Victims (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 293, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5602);
7. Law Number 21 Year 2007 concerning the Eradication of the Criminal Act of Trafficking in Persons (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2007 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4720);
8. Law Number 12 Year 2011 concerning the Formation of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2011 Number 82 Supplement....
Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5234) as amended several times most recently by Law Number 13 Year 2022 concerning the Second Amendment to Law Number 12 Year 2011 concerning the Formation of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2022 Number 143, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6801);
9. Law Number 23 Year 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587) as amended several times most recently by Law Number 9 Year 2015 concerning the Second Amendment to Law Number 23 Year 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2015 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5679);
10. Law Number 30 Year 2014 concerning Government Administration (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 292, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia 5601);
11. Law Number 12 Year 2022 concerning the Criminal Act of Sexual Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2022 Number 120, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6792);
12. Government Regulation Number 4 Year 2006 concerning the Implementation and Cooperation of Recovery of Victims of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2006 Number 15, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4604);
13. Regulation.....5 5-
13. Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 80 Year 2015 concerning the Formation of Regional Legal Products (State News of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2015 Number 2036) as amended by Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 120 Year 2018 concerning Amendment to Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 80 Year 2015 concerning the Formation of Regional Legal Products (State News of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2018 Number 157);
14. Regulation of the Minister of Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 2 Year 2022 concerning Service Standards for the Protection of Women and Children (State News of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2022 Number 85);
15. Regional Regulation Number 5 Year 2016 concerning the Establishment and Composition of Regional Apparatus (Regional Gazette of Bungo Regency Year 2016 Number 5), as amended by Regional Regulation Number 12 Year 2019 concerning Amendment to Regional Regulation Number 5 Year 2016 concerning the Establishment and Composition of Regional Apparatus (Regional Gazette of Bungo Regency Year 2019 Number 12);

With Mutual Approval

